<Docs><section class="docs-card"><h2>One brand. A usable reference.</h2><p>Build on the existing BotsFired marks, palette and type. Start with foundations, choose a component, then adapt an application starter.</p><div class="docs-actions"><a class="ds-download" href="/logos/">Explore logo assets</a><a class="ds-download" href="/components/">Build with components</a><a class="ds-download" href="/color/">Inspect tokens &amp; contrast</a></div></section><section class="reference-grid"><article class="docs-card"><h2>Foundations</h2><p>Navy and fire, editorial Barlow Condensed, readable Inter and human annotations. Original masters stay intact.</p><ul><li><a href="/color/">Primitive, semantic and component tokens</a></li><li><a href="/typography/">Fluid type and readable metadata</a></li><li><a href="/motion/">Spacing, elevation, motion and icons</a></li></ul></article><article class="docs-card"><h2>Applications</h2><p>Editorial examples, editable deck, merchandise placement and call backgrounds. New application files are starters, not approved masters.</p><ul><li><a href="/applications/">Application starters</a></li><li><a href="/templates/">Illustrative editorial templates</a></li><li><a href="/assets-library/">Formats and asset purpose</a></li></ul></article></section><section class="docs-card"><h2>Review before release</h2><p>Every fictional metric, persona, testimonial, affiliation and date in demonstrations is placeholder copy. Confirm facts and production requirements before publishing.</p><p>High contrast and dark mode are reading preferences. Original brand specimens retain their own colours. The reference remains unlisted public content.</p><a href="/governance/">Governance, migration and review checklist</a></section></Docs>
